<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>第7课 · 字典与集合 —— 图鉴系统</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0d1021; --bg2:#141833; --card:#1a1f3d;
    --gold:#f5c542; --cyan:#9be8ff; --purple:#a78bfa;
    --green:#4dd6ff; --pink:#f472b6; --orange:#fb923c;
    --red:#f87171; --text:#e8eaf6; --muted:#8b93b8; --line:#2a3060;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% -10%, rgba(77,214,255,.10), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 95% 90%, rgba(77,214,255,.08), transparent);
  }
  .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 80px;}
  /* 头部 */
  .crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .crumb b{color:var(--green);}
  header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .lesson-badge{
    display:inline-block;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.12);color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(77,214,255,.35);margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#4dd6ff,#9be8ff 50%,#f5c542);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .subtitle{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;}
  .mission{
    margin-top:18px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 22px;text-align:left;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mission h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .mission li{margin-left:18px;}
  /* 板块 */
  section{
    background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;
    padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:26px;animation:fadeUp .6s ease both;
  }
  section:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.05s;}
  section h2{
    font-size:19px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .num{
    width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4dd6ff,#9be8ff);
    color:#0d1021;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  section p{margin-bottom:10px;}
  .hl{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
  .hl-c{color:#4dd6ff;font-weight:600;}
  /* 代码块 */
  .code{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:14px;overflow-x:auto;margin:12px 0;position:relative;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .code .c{color:#5b648f;}   /* 注释 */
  .code .k{color:var(--pink);} /* 关键字/函数 */
  .code .s{color:#4dd6ff;} /* 字符串 */
  .code .n{color:var(--orange);} /* 数字 */
  .code .v{color:var(--cyan);}  /* 变量 */
  .out{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;
    color:#a5ecff;margin-top:-4px;margin-bottom:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .out::before{content:"▶ 输出：";color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
  /* 键值对卡片动画 */
  .boxes{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0;}
  .mbox{
    width:150px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:14px;
    padding:14px;text-align:center;position:relative;transition:all .3s;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .mbox:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.04);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(77,214,255,.25);}
  .mbox .tag{
    font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4dd6ff;
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;display:inline-block;
  }
  .mbox .val{
    font-size:22px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 4px;color:var(--gold);word-break:break-all;
  }
  .mbox .tip{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}
  /* 报错面板 */
  .traceback{
    background:#180f1d;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;
    color:#f8a0b0;margin:12px 0;white-space:pre-wrap;animation:popIn .35s both;
  }
  /* 字典芯片 */
  .chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0;min-height:34px;}
  .chip{
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
    padding:3px 10px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--cyan);
    animation:popIn .3s both;
  }
  .chip b{color:var(--gold);}
  /* 韦恩图 */
  .venn{position:relative;height:180px;margin:18px 0;}
  .circle{
    position:absolute;top:8px;width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;
  }
  .circle.ca{left:calc(50% - 170px);border:2px dashed #4dd6ff;background:rgba(77,214,255,.07);}
  .circle.cb{left:calc(50% + 10px);border:2px dashed var(--purple);background:rgba(167,139,250,.07);}
  .setlabel{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;margin-top:12px;padding:0 6px;text-align:center;}
  /* 实验室 */
  .lab-input{
    display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0;align-items:center;
  }
  .lab-input input{
    flex:1;min-width:180px;background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid #4dd6ff;border-radius:10px;
    padding:11px 16px;color:var(--text);font-size:15px;outline:none;
  }
  .lab-input input:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(77,214,255,.18);}
  .btn{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4dd6ff,#9be8ff);color:#0d1021;border:none;
    padding:11px 26px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .15s, box-shadow .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(77,214,255,.3);}
  .btn.ghost{background:#0a0d1e;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);}
  .hero-card{
    display:none;margin-top:16px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#1d2448,#141833);
    border:2px solid var(--gold);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 26px;
    animation:popIn .45s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1) both;
  }
  .hero-card.show{display:block;}
  .hero-card h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .hero-card .attr{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0;}
  .hero-card .attr div{text-align:center;}
  .hero-card .attr b{font-size:26px;display:block;}
  .hero-card .attr span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}
  .hero-card .rarity{color:var(--purple);font-weight:700;}
  .hero-card .quote{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-style:italic;margin-top:8px;}
  /* 进度条 */
  .progress-wrap{background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;height:18px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0 4px;}
  .progress-fill{height:100%;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4dd6ff,#9be8ff);transition:width .5s ease;}
  .progress-label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;}
  /* 预言机 */
  .oracle-q{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .oracle-q .qtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--purple);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;}
  .oracle-opts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;}
  .opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;color:var(--text);
    padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;
    transition:all .2s;
  }
  .opt:hover{border-color:#4dd6ff;}
  .opt.right{border-color:#4dd6ff;background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);color:#4dd6ff;}
  .opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);color:var(--red);}
  .explain{
    display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);
    border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;
  }
  .explain.show{display:block;animation:fadeIn .4s;}
  /* 记忆卡片 */
  .cards-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px;
  }
  .mcard{
    perspective:800px;height:130px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .mcard-inner{
    position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .55s;
    transform-style:preserve-3d;
  }
  .mcard.flip .mcard-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg);}
  .mface{
    position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:13px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
    padding:12px;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mfront{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1d2448,#141833);border:1px solid var(--cyan);color:#4dd6ff;font-weight:600;}
  .mback{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16284a,#101530);border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--text);transform:rotateY(180deg);font-size:13px;}
  .cards-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;}
  /* Quiz */
  .quiz-q{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .quiz-q .qq{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;}
  .quiz-q .qq i{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal;margin-right:6px;}
  .qq-opts{display:grid;gap:8px;}
  .qq-opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);
    padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:all .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .qq-opt:hover{border-color:#4dd6ff;}
  .qq-opt.right{border-color:#4dd6ff;background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);}
  .qq-opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);}
  .qq-exp{display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;}
  .qq-exp.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result{
    display:none;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--gold);animation:popIn .4s both;
  }
  #quiz-result.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result b{font-size:34px;color:var(--gold);display:block;}
  /* 课后任务 */
  .homework li{margin:8px 0 8px 18px;}
  .homework code{background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);color:#4dd6ff;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;}
  footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
  @keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="crumb">◈ 装备库 · <b>第 7 课 / 共 26 课</b></div>

  <header>
    <div class="lesson-badge">STAGE 2 · ARMORY</div>
    <h1>字典与集合 —— 图鉴系统</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">今日目标：用「键值对」给万物建档，用集合一键去重</div>
    <div class="mission">
      <h3>📜 今日任务清单</h3>
      <li>学会用 <span class="hl">{键: 值}</span> 创建字典，按「键」一击取值</li>
      <li>掌握 <span class="hl">.get()</span> 护盾，从此告别 KeyError 爆炸</li>
      <li>增删改、<span class="hl">keys()/values()/items()</span> 遍历、in 岗哨</li>
      <li>玩转嵌套字典图鉴 + 集合去重、交并差</li>
      <li>通关实验室「怪物图鉴收集系统」+ 预言机 5 连 + Quiz ≥ 80 分</li>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 1 字典 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">1</span>字典：给数据贴上「名牌」</h2>
    <p>列表取值靠<b>位置</b>（下标），但没人记得住第 3 格放的是什么。字典取值靠<b>名字</b>——每个数据都挂一块名牌：<span class="hl">键（key）→ 值（value）</span>。</p>
    <p>就像游戏图鉴：喊「史莱姆」，立刻调出它的全部资料。</p>

    <div class="boxes" id="bag-boxes">
      <div class="mbox" onclick="pickCard(this)" data-k="金币" data-v="300"><div class="tag">"金币"</div><div class="val">300</div><div class="tip">键 → 值</div></div>
      <div class="mbox" onclick="pickCard(this)" data-k="药水" data-v="3"><div class="tag">"药水"</div><div class="val">3</div><div class="tip">键 → 值</div></div>
      <div class="mbox" onclick="pickCard(this)" data-k="地图" data-v="1"><div class="tag">"地图"</div><div class="val">1</div><div class="tip">键 → 值</div></div>
    </div>

    <p>👆 点击卡片试试「按键取值」，下方会同步显示等价 Python 代码：</p>
    <div class="code" id="pick-code" style="display:none"></div>
    <div class="out" id="pick-out" style="display:none"></div>

    <p>创建字典用<span class="hl">大括号 {}</span>，键和值之间用<span class="hl-c">冒号</span>，一对一对写：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">bag</span> = {<span class="s">"金币"</span>: <span class="n">300</span>, <span class="s">"药水"</span>: <span class="n">3</span>, <span class="s">"地图"</span>: <span class="n">1</span>}
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">bag</span>[<span class="s">"金币"</span>])   <span class="c"># 中括号里放「键」，取出「值」</span></div>
    <div class="out">300</div>

    <p>⚠️ 键必须<b>唯一</b>，写重复了后者会覆盖前者：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">d</span> = {<span class="s">"a"</span>: <span class="n">1</span>, <span class="s">"a"</span>: <span class="n">2</span>}
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">d</span>)   <span class="c"># {'a': 2} —— 同名键，只留最后一个</span></div>
    <div class="out">{'a': 2}</div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 KeyError 与 get -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">2</span>KeyError 陷阱 与 .get() 护盾</h2>
    <p>用中括号取一个<span class="hl">不存在的键</span>，程序当场爆炸——这就是新手榜排行第二的报错 <span class="hl-c">KeyError</span>（第一名还是老朋友 TypeError）。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">dex</span> = {<span class="s">"史莱姆"</span>: <span class="n">30</span>, <span class="s">"哥布林"</span>: <span class="n">45</span>}
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">dex</span>[<span class="s">"火龙"</span>])   <span class="c"># 💥 图鉴里没有火龙 → KeyError: '火龙'</span></div>

    <p>🛡 护盾咒语 <span class="hl">.get(键, 默认值)</span>：查得到返回值，查不到返回默认值，<b>绝不报错</b>。亲自试试两种取值方式的差别：</p>
    <div class="lab-input">
      <button class="btn" onclick="tryDirect()">☠ 裸取 dex[火龙]</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="tryGet()">🛡 安全取 dex.get(火龙)</button>
    </div>
    <div class="traceback" id="key-err" style="display:none"></div>
    <div class="code" id="get-code" style="display:none"><span class="v">dex</span> = {<span class="s">"史莱姆"</span>: <span class="n">30</span>}
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">dex</span>.get(<span class="s">"火龙"</span>))       <span class="c"># 查不到 → 返回 None，不报错</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">dex</span>.get(<span class="s">"火龙"</span>, <span class="n">99</span>))   <span class="c"># 查不到 → 返回默认值 99</span></div>
    <div class="out" id="get-out" style="display:none">None
99</div>
    <p>🧠 记忆口诀：<span class="hl">中括号是赌命，.get() 是保命。</span>不确定键存不存在时，永远用 .get()。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 增删改 + in -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">3</span>增删改 与 in 岗哨</h2>
    <p>字典是「活」的：同一句 <span class="hl-c">d[键] = 值</span>，键不存在就是<b>新增</b>，键已存在就是<b>修改</b>（覆盖旧值）。删除用 <span class="hl">del</span> 或 <span class="hl">.pop()</span>。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">bag</span> = {<span class="s">"金币"</span>: <span class="n">300</span>, <span class="s">"药水"</span>: <span class="n">3</span>}
<span class="v">bag</span>[<span class="s">"卷轴"</span>] = <span class="n">2</span>        <span class="c"># 增：键不存在 → 新增</span>
<span class="v">bag</span>[<span class="s">"金币"</span>] = <span class="n">500</span>      <span class="c"># 改：键已存在 → 覆盖</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">bag</span>)             <span class="c"># {'金币': 500, '药水': 3, '卷轴': 2}</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">bag</span>.pop(<span class="s">"药水"</span>))  <span class="c"># 删：pop 删除并返回被删的值</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">bag</span>)             <span class="c"># {'金币': 500, '卷轴': 2}</span></div>
    <div class="out">{'金币': 500, '药水': 3, '卷轴': 2}
3
{'金币': 500, '卷轴': 2}</div>

    <p>👆 动手改造一个字典试试（芯片会实时变化，代码同步显示）：</p>
    <div class="chips" id="bag-chips"></div>
    <div class="lab-input">
      <button class="btn" onclick="bagAdd()">➕ 加 卷轴</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="bagMod()">🔁 改 药水 ×5</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="bagDel()">❌ 删 地图</button>
    </div>
    <div class="code" id="bag-code" style="display:none"></div>

    <p>动手前先问一句「键在不在」？<span class="hl">in 岗哨</span>帮你站岗——注意：<span class="hl">in 判断的是键，不是值</span>。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">bag</span> = {<span class="s">"金币"</span>: <span class="n">300</span>, <span class="s">"药水"</span>: <span class="n">3</span>}
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"药水"</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="v">bag</span>)   <span class="c"># True —— "药水" 是键</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="n">300</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="v">bag</span>)     <span class="c"># False —— 300 是值，in 不查值</span></div>
    <div class="out">True
False</div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 遍历与嵌套 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">4</span>遍历 与 嵌套：真正的怪物图鉴</h2>
    <p>字典有三大遍历姿势：<span class="hl">keys()</span> 只拿键、<span class="hl">values()</span> 只拿值、<span class="hl">items()</span> 键值对一起拿（最常用）。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">bag</span> = {<span class="s">"金币"</span>: <span class="n">300</span>, <span class="s">"药水"</span>: <span class="n">3</span>}
<span class="k">for</span> <span class="v">k</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="v">bag</span>:                <span class="c"># 直接遍历字典 = 遍历键</span>
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">k</span>)
<span class="k">for</span> <span class="v">k</span>, <span class="v">v</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="v">bag</span>.items():    <span class="c"># 两个变量接住键值对（解包）</span>
